    "text": "Hi everyone! :wave: I’m working on \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake/issues/1317|OLake issue #1317\u003e, which aims to commit Go checksum files and ensure `go.mod` stays tidy through lint checks.\nMy plan is to:\n• Remove `go.sum` and `go.work.sum` from `.gitignore`.\n• Add `go mod tidy -diff` checks to `make olake.lint` and `make test.lint`.\n• Update the pre-commit hook to run relevant checks when dependency files change.\nI’ll verify everything by running `make gomod` and testing both lint targets.\nPlease share any suggestions or feedback. Thanks!",
